{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20209","headline":"吊元鲁山 八 · 孟郊","name":"吊元鲁山 八","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"当今富教化，元后得贤相。\n冰心镜衰古，霜议清遐障。\n幽埋尽洸洗，滞旅免流浪。\n唯余鲁山名，未获旌廉让。\n二三贞苦士，刷视耸危望。\n发秋青山夜，目断丹阙亮。\n诱类幸从兹，嘉招固非妄。\n小生奏狂狷，感惕增万状。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孟郊","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_20209.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20209","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}